{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-frobenius-pairing-unique","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:frobenius-pairing-unique","kind":"proposition","title":"Uniqueness of the Frobenius pairing","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-frobenius-pairing-exists"],"proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-frobenius-pairing-unique"],"tags":["uniqueness","frobenius-pairing","quantum-universe"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.FrobeniusHopfData.frobeniusForm_unique","text":"frobenius-pairing-unique.md","leanSource":"frobenius-pairing-unique.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:frobenius-pairing-unique\"></a><p>The Frobenius pairing is canonical up to overall scale. Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(\\mathbf{C}, A, \\tau)</code> be a <a href=\"#def:quantum-universe\" data-at=\"quantum-universes/quantum-universe\">quantum universe</a> with <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A</code> simple. Any two non-degenerate Frobenius forms <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\int_A^{(1)}, \\int_A^{(2)}</code> differ by an invertible scalar:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\int_A^{(2)} \\;=\\; c  \\int_A^{(1)}\n  \\qquad\\text{for some } c \\in \\mathrm{Aut}_{\\mathbf{C}}(\\mathbf{1}).</code></pre>\n<p>The induced <a href=\"#def:frobenius-pairing\" data-at=\"quantum-universes/quantum-universe\">Frobenius pairings</a> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\langle \\cdot, \\cdot \\rangle_i = \\int_A^{(i)} \\circ \\mu</code> differ by the same scalar.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/frobenius-pairing-unique.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"3.4.1","page":"b/prop-frobenius-pairing-unique","qa":{"counts":{"pass":92,"fail":1,"warn":2,"na":9,"unknown":0,"stale":80},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":1}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.FrobeniusHopfData.frobeniusForm_unique_of_schur","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/frobenius-pairing-unique.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
